1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,360
The bottom touched the earth and the top reached the heaven.

2
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:05,840
Christ, fully divine, fully human.

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:10,800
Every time the priest went into that, he had to wash his feet.

4
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:18,160
He could not bring a particle of dirt into the tabernacle,

5
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:20,560
even though when he walked in, he was walking on dirt.

6
00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:26,800
Because God is, give me the word, holy.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,600
It's been my observation.

8
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:39,840
I'm very glad there's no theme so that you allow the Spirit to tell the preachers what to say.

9
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:46,320
God is universally disrespected.

10
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:50,720
I mean disrespected.

11
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:59,680
Not maliciously, but because we do not dwell enough on the holiness of God.

